# Unstoppable

> ICANN-accredited domain registrar offering traditional DNS domains with competitive pricing and full management tools.

## About

Unstoppable is an ICANN-accredited domain registrar providing:
- Hundreds of TLDs including .com, .net, .org, .io, .co, .ai, and country-code TLDs
- Competitive pricing and transparent renewals
- Full DNS management and domain privacy protection
- Integration with major aftermarket platforms

## Domain Registration

Register traditional DNS domains with:
- Hundreds of TLDs available
- Competitive pricing
- Easy domain search and checkout
- Instant activation

## DNS Management

Full control over your domains:
- Complete DNS record management (A, AAAA, CNAME, MX, TXT, etc.)
- Domain forwarding and redirects
- WHOIS privacy protection
- Email forwarding

## Domain Marketplace

Secondary market for buying and selling domains:
- List domains for sale on Unstoppable marketplace
- Integrated with major aftermarket platforms: Sedo, Afternic
- Make offers on premium and user-listed domains
- Competitive commission rates

## Domain Transfers

Move domains easily:
- Import domains from other registrars
- Export domains to other providers
- Bulk transfer support
- No hidden transfer fees

## Bulk Operations

Tools for domain investors and businesses:
- Bulk domain registration
- Bulk listing management
- Portfolio analytics
- CSV import/export

## Payment Methods

Multiple ways to purchase:
- Credit/debit cards
- PayPal
- Apple Pay, Google Pay
- Bank wire transfer (funds account balance)

## Security

Protect your account and domains:
- Two-factor authentication (2FA)
- Domain lock protection
- Account recovery options

## Mobile App

Manage domains on the go:
- Available on iOS (App Store) and Android (Play Store)
- Full domain management
- Push notifications for expiring domains

## Partner API

Integrate Unstoppable into your application:
- White-label domain registration
- Reseller program
- Affiliate program for referrals

